vides a fresh take on a beloved pastime. By adhering to the standard Sudoku regulations and the added guidelines for gray-lined regions, you can work your way towards filling in the empty cells and completing the puzzle. Don't forget to purchase the Observer Digital Edition to access the complete solution and compare your progress with the final result.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.0005393957253545523}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.6597992181777954}, {"token": "print", "logprob": -0.8318459391593933}, {"token": "version", "logprob": -0.0014735327567905188}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -3.6954811548639555e-06}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.0431404709815979}, {"token": "Sud", "logprob": -0.11919358372688293}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "puzzle", "logprob": -9.738924563862383e-05}, {"token": "is", "logprob": -0.0024796947836875916}, {"token": "available", "logprob": -0.0001394651480950415}, {"token": "through", "logprob": -0.43851351737976074}, {"token": "this", "logprob": -0.029750879853963852}, {"token": "link", "logprob": -0.00016139635408762842}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.006414301693439484}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.0007457336178049445}, {"token": "standard", "logprob": -0.10093673318624496}, {"token": "regulations", "logprob": -0.8368189930915833}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -0.2266676425933838}, {"token": "Sud", "logprob": -0.0013366345083341002}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "apply", "logprob": -0.013297210447490215}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.013398959301412106}, {"token": "but", "logprob": -0.5246409177780151}, {"token": "there", "logprob": -0.20360063016414642}, {"token": "are", "logprob": -0.12726283073425293}, {"token": "added", "logprob": -2.9035091400146484}, {"token": "rules", "logprob": -0.07029575854539871}, {"token": "for", "logprob": -0.0035149003379046917}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.054212696850299835}, {"token": "sections", "logprob": -0.9833874106407166}, {"token": "en", "logprob": -